het ms&#39;,sans-serif\">El </span><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\"><span lang=\"CA\">Dr. John Fox impartirà una conferència sota el títol:</span></font><i style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"CA\"> “An Overview of the R-Project and R-Commander”.</span></i></font></p>\r\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\"><font color=\"#000066\"> </font></span></p>\r\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#000066\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\"><span lang=\"CA\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Catedràtic del departament de sociologia de la McMaster University de Canadà, e</font></span></font><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">l Dr. Fox </span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">és el creador del paquet d’R “R-commander”.</span></font></p>\r\n</div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font color=\"#000066\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\">Per a més informació, podeu consultar la web de la SCE:</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\"> </span><a href=\"http://www.socestadistica.org/\" style=\"font-family:&#39;trebuchet ms&#39;,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.socestadistica.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242856974000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0JAlUGmEjVnqN_Lg9-0jWk\">www.socestadistica.org</a></font></p>\r\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:13px;